[# social-proof/customer-stats: customer numbers ("10,000+ Customers", "4.9 average rating") in a row, with a heading.

   A preset of stats/stat-grid for social proof. Only use numbers that are true and current.

   Compatibility
   - Outlook desktop: each row is a table with exact widths.
   - Gmail apps: two per row on phones uses a media query. Gmail on non-Google accounts shows the desktop layout.
   - Dark mode: swaps via dm-* classes when on the brand surface or background color. #]
[[ c('stats/stat-grid', { heading: data.heading, stats: data.stats }, { variant: s.gridVariant, settings: { background: s.background, hideOnMobile: s.hideOnMobile, hideOnDesktop: s.hideOnDesktop } }) ]]
